Package: ros.db.atlas
Title: IOTC ROS Database Metadata and Documentation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Tony", "Chemit", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "tchemit@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Extracts PostgreSQL metadata for the IOTC Regional Observer
    Scheme database version 4.0.0, applies descriptions from editable metadata
    files, and generates branded HTML reports and interactive dependency graphs
    using db.tools and db.atlas.
